Replit return refund policy US.excerpt:
The billing policy is also something people should understand before spending heavily. Replit’s published terms say subscription payments can be refunded within 30 days, but usage-based charges are generally treated as non-refundable because the compute has already been consumed. [...] I have requested a full refund under Replit’s 30-day subscription policy and raised a dispute with my bank. Replit needs to refund this charge and fix its payment portal UI. [...] I would strongly recommend that anyone considering Replit:  

 keep strict spending limits;  
 create backups/checkpoints before every Agent change;  
 verify every claimed completion manually;  
 do not let Agent make large uncontrolled changes to an existing working project; and  
 understand the usage refund policy before spending significant amounts.
